msgctxt "help:account.financial.statement.template.line,previous_value:"
msgid ""
"Value calculation formula: Depending on this formula the final value is calculated as follows:\n"
"- Empy template value: sum of (this concept) children values.\n"
"- Number with decimal point (\"10.2\"): that value (constant).\n"
"- A matematic formula with following helpers:\n"
"  * balance() with comma-separated account numbers. Sum of the accounts (the sign of the depends on the mode).\n"
"  * invert() with comma-separated account numbers. Sum of the account (the sign is inverted if reversed modes are used).\n"
"  * credit() with comma-separeted account numbers. Sum of the credit of the account if the total amount is negative. Zero otherwise.\n"
"  * debit() with comma-separeted account numbers. Sum of the debit of the account if the total amount is positive. Zero otherwise.\n"
"  * concept() with comma-separated concept codes in quotes of the report itself (column Code). Sum of the concept values.\n"
"Examples:\n"
"balance(430, 431) + invert(437)\n"
"balance(5305, 5315) + invert(5325, 5335) + debit(551, 5525)\n"
"balance(5103) + credit(5523)\n"
"concept(\"11000\", \"12000\")\n"
"balance(7) - 1.25 * balance(6)\n"
"concept(\"101\") / 2"
msgstr ""
"数值计算公式：根据此公式，最终值按以下方式计算：\n"
"- 模板值为空：此项目所有子项的值之和。\n"
"- 带小数点的数字（“10.2”）：使用该常量值。\n"
"- 使用以下辅助函数的数学公式：\n"
"  * balance()：参数为逗号分隔的科目编号，返回科目余额之和（符号取决于模式）。\n"
"  * invert()：参数为逗号分隔的科目编号，返回科目余额之和（使用反向模式时符号取反）。\n"
"  * credit()：参数为逗号分隔的科目编号；总额为负时返回科目贷方金额之和，否则返回零。\n"
"  * debit()：参数为逗号分隔的科目编号；总额为正时返回科目借方金额之和，否则返回零。\n"
"  * concept()：参数为本报表中加引号并以逗号分隔的项目代码（“代码”列），返回项目值之和。\n"
"示例：\n"
"balance(430, 431) + invert(437)\n"
"balance(5305, 5315) + invert(5325, 5335) + debit(551, 5525)\n"
"balance(5103) + credit(5523)\n"
"concept(\"11000\", \"12000\")\n"
"balance(7) - 1.25 * balance(6)\n"
"concept(\"101\") / 2"
